# R3 fixture04 bounded-wait extension review

Date: 2026-11-02. Status: `CLEAR_DOCUMENTARY_VIABILITY`.

Reviewer `/root/daily_report_package` cleared the exact amendment: 2,728 bytes, SHA-256 `308b42ceee5e0215a9e6ec0302e595a05116a5006be0ee15dc719d6e24a11e0c`.

It explicitly permits the already published/static-reviewed waiter to bootstrap its own formal verification harness. The same fixed600-second/5-second protocol and2 GB thresholds apply before preflight and each child, with fresh root04, durable wait evidence, fatal timeout/interruption/error, no extra process and no child before PASS. Final PASS still requires the entire suite and valid closed evidence. Earlier failures remain immutable; no scientific or real B06/C authority is added.

Root accepts the documentary review and authorizes implementation of the new fixture04 harness after this amendment/review are published byte-exactly. Code/static review/final binding/publication precede its one formal attempt. No execution occurred in this review.
